			<description><![CDATA[<p>All In Football FPL Show - Fan View Series 26/27 EP 4 - Arsenal</p><br><p>A podcast episode covering Arsenal's 2024/25 season outlook, transfer activity, and FPL team-building strategy. Arsenal are identified as the only team with a genuine title-winning ambition, backed by strong squad depth, stable ownership, and Arteta's long-term project. FPL discussion focused on key Arsenal assets, chip strategy, and early-season fixture planning.</p><br><p>0:00 Introduction &amp; Episode Overview (Generated by AI)</p><p>2:15 Arsenal Season Outlook - Title Favourites</p><p>5:30 Squad Depth &amp; Arteta's Long-Term Project</p><p>9:45 Transfer Window Review - Bruno Guimarães Signing</p><p>13:20 Tzolis Analysis &amp; Martinelli Situation</p><p>16:40 Vinicius Jr Transfer Saga</p><p>20:10 Striker Position - Havertz vs Gyokeres</p><p>23:30 Other Transfer Links - Quansah, Konsa &amp; Lewis Skelly</p><p>26:45 Expected Starting XI vs Coventry (GW1)</p><p>30:20 FPL Strategy - Key Arsenal Assets</p><p>35:15 Tzolis &amp; Odegaard FPL Analysis</p><p>38:50 Bruno Fernandes - The Must-Have Pick</p><p>42:30 Chip Strategy - Bench Boost GW2</p><p>46:10 David's Current FPL Team Breakdown</p><p>50:25 Season Predictions - Top 5 &amp; Relegation</p><p>54:40 Closing Thoughts &amp; Next Episode Preview</p><br><p>Presented by 'The FPL Guru' Alex Rex.</p><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></description>
			<itunes:summary><![CDATA[<p>All In Football FPL Show - Fan View Series 26/27 EP 4 - Arsenal</p><br><p>A podcast episode covering Arsenal's 2024/25 season outlook, transfer activity, and FPL team-building strategy. Arsenal are identified as the only team with a genuine title-winning ambition, backed by strong squad depth, stable ownership, and Arteta's long-term project. FPL discussion focused on key Arsenal assets, chip strategy, and early-season fixture planning.</p><br><p>0:00 Introduction &amp; Episode Overview (Generated by AI)</p><p>2:15 Arsenal Season Outlook - Title Favourites</p><p>5:30 Squad Depth &amp; Arteta's Long-Term Project</p><p>9:45 Transfer Window Review - Bruno Guimarães Signing</p><p>13:20 Tzolis Analysis &amp; Martinelli Situation</p><p>16:40 Vinicius Jr Transfer Saga</p><p>20:10 Striker Position - Havertz vs Gyokeres</p><p>23:30 Other Transfer Links - Quansah, Konsa &amp; Lewis Skelly</p><p>26:45 Expected Starting XI vs Coventry (GW1)</p><p>30:20 FPL Strategy - Key Arsenal Assets</p><p>35:15 Tzolis &amp; Odegaard FPL Analysis</p><p>38:50 Bruno Fernandes - The Must-Have Pick</p><p>42:30 Chip Strategy - Bench Boost GW2</p><p>46:10 David's Current FPL Team Breakdown</p><p>50:25 Season Predictions - Top 5 &amp; Relegation</p><p>54:40 Closing Thoughts &amp; Next Episode Preview</p><br><p>Presented by 'The FPL Guru' Alex Rex.</p><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></itunes:summary>
