			<title>All In Football FPL Show - Fan View Series 26/27 EP 3 - Aston Villa</title>
			<itunes:title>All In Football FPL Show - Fan View Series 26/27 EP 3 - Aston Villa</itunes:title>
			<pubDate>Mon, 17 Aug 2026 15:47:11 GMT</pubDate>
			<itunes:duration>28:08</itunes:duration>
			<enclosure url="https://sphinx.acast.com/p/open/s/604b79bc69ef087644689f81/e/6a832d00ee8d08ccf03b3d59/media.mp3" length="27016045" type="audio/mpeg"/>
			<guid isPermaLink="false">6a832d00ee8d08ccf03b3d59</guid>
			<itunes:explicit>true</itunes:explicit>
			<link>https://shows.acast.com/all-in-football/episodes/all-in-football-fpl-show-fan-view-series-2627-ep-3-aston-vil</link>
			<acast:episodeId>6a832d00ee8d08ccf03b3d59</acast:episodeId>
			<acast:showId>604b79bc69ef087644689f81</acast:showId>
			<acast:episodeUrl>all-in-football-fpl-show-fan-view-series-2627-ep-3-aston-vil</acast:episodeUrl>
			<acast:settings><![CDATA[]]></acast:settings>
			<itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
			<itunes:season>6</itunes:season>
			<itunes:episode>3</itunes:episode>
			<itunes:image href="https://assets.pippa.io/shows/604b79bc69ef087644689f81/1655732707456-28c57a5606dd349fb8f0c0480945c29e.jpeg"/>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>All In Football FPL Show - Fan View Series 26/27 EP 3 - Aston Villa</p><br><p>🎥 Aston Villa 2026/27 Season Preview | Squad Crisis, Transfer Drama &amp; FPL Tips</p><br><p>Villa face a challenging start to the new season with a squad in transition. Despite missing Martinez, Konsa, and Watkins throughout pre-season, they impressed against PSG in the UEFA Super Cup — outperforming them on shots and xG with a heavily depleted lineup.</p><br><p>🔴 What We Cover:</p><p>•Major departures: Rogers, Digne, and Teilemans</p><p>•Injury crisis: Onana (season-long), Manzambi, Joao Gomes, and Madjo all unavailable</p><p>•New signings: Manzambi, Joao Gomes, Garnacho (loan), and potential Suzuki arrival</p><p>•Martinez transfer saga — Juventus deal collapsed, future uncertain</p><p>•Arsenal's interest in Konsa — will Villa hold firm on valuation?</p><p>•Breakout star Brian Madjo (17) — 5 goals in pre-season before injury</p><p>•Predicted XI vs Brighton with major question marks in goal and midfield</p><p>•FPL recommendations: Buendia (£6M) as a differential, McGinn (£5.5M) for depth, avoid Villa defenders</p><br><p>Can Emery work his magic again with a reshuffled squad? We break down Villa's prospects, key players to watch, and whether they're worth your FPL investment.</p><br><p>Presented by 'The FPL Guru' Alex Rex.</p><br><p>⚽ Timestamps:</p><p>1.00:00 — Introduction &amp; Pre-Season Overview</p><p>2.02:15 — Squad Departures &amp; Losses</p><p>3.04:30 — Injury Crisis Analysis</p><p>4.06:45 — New Signings Breakdown</p><p>5.09:20 — Martinez Transfer Situation</p><p>6.11:00 — Konsa to Arsenal?</p><p>7.12:30 — Super Cup vs PSG Highlights</p><p>8.15:00 — Predicted Starting XI vs Brighton</p><p>9.17:30 — FPL Tips &amp; Recommendations</p><p>10.20:00 — Final Thoughts</p><br><p><br></p><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></description>
			<itunes:summary><![CDATA[<p>All In Football FPL Show - Fan View Series 26/27 EP 3 - Aston Villa</p><br><p>🎥 Aston Villa 2026/27 Season Preview | Squad Crisis, Transfer Drama &amp; FPL Tips</p><br><p>Villa face a challenging start to the new season with a squad in transition. Despite missing Martinez, Konsa, and Watkins throughout pre-season, they impressed against PSG in the UEFA Super Cup — outperforming them on shots and xG with a heavily depleted lineup.</p><br><p>🔴 What We Cover:</p><p>•Major departures: Rogers, Digne, and Teilemans</p><p>•Injury crisis: Onana (season-long), Manzambi, Joao Gomes, and Madjo all unavailable</p><p>•New signings: Manzambi, Joao Gomes, Garnacho (loan), and potential Suzuki arrival</p><p>•Martinez transfer saga — Juventus deal collapsed, future uncertain</p><p>•Arsenal's interest in Konsa — will Villa hold firm on valuation?</p><p>•Breakout star Brian Madjo (17) — 5 goals in pre-season before injury</p><p>•Predicted XI vs Brighton with major question marks in goal and midfield</p><p>•FPL recommendations: Buendia (£6M) as a differential, McGinn (£5.5M) for depth, avoid Villa defenders</p><br><p>Can Emery work his magic again with a reshuffled squad? We break down Villa's prospects, key players to watch, and whether they're worth your FPL investment.</p><br><p>Presented by 'The FPL Guru' Alex Rex.</p><br><p>⚽ Timestamps:</p><p>1.00:00 — Introduction &amp; Pre-Season Overview</p><p>2.02:15 — Squad Departures &amp; Losses</p><p>3.04:30 — Injury Crisis Analysis</p><p>4.06:45 — New Signings Breakdown</p><p>5.09:20 — Martinez Transfer Situation</p><p>6.11:00 — Konsa to Arsenal?</p><p>7.12:30 — Super Cup vs PSG Highlights</p><p>8.15:00 — Predicted Starting XI vs Brighton</p><p>9.17:30 — FPL Tips &amp; Recommendations</p><p>10.20:00 — Final Thoughts</p><br><p><br></p><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></itunes:summary>
		</item>
