			<title>All In Football FPL Show - Fan View Series 26/27 EP 2 - Leeds United</title>
			<itunes:title>All In Football FPL Show - Fan View Series 26/27 EP 2 - Leeds United</itunes:title>
			<pubDate>Mon, 17 Aug 2026 15:43:05 GMT</pubDate>
			<itunes:duration>1:01:23</itunes:duration>
			<enclosure url="https://sphinx.acast.com/p/open/s/604b79bc69ef087644689f81/e/6a832c094394d6874b2cc1ee/media.mp3" length="35607814" type="audio/mpeg"/>
			<guid isPermaLink="false">6a832c094394d6874b2cc1ee</guid>
			<itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
			<link>https://shows.acast.com/all-in-football/episodes/all-in-football-fpl-show-fan-view-series-2627-ep-2-leeds-uni</link>
			<acast:episodeId>6a832c094394d6874b2cc1ee</acast:episodeId>
			<acast:showId>604b79bc69ef087644689f81</acast:showId>
			<acast:episodeUrl>all-in-football-fpl-show-fan-view-series-2627-ep-2-leeds-uni</acast:episodeUrl>
			<acast:settings><![CDATA[]]></acast:settings>
			<itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
			<itunes:season>6</itunes:season>
			<itunes:episode>2</itunes:episode>
			<itunes:image href="https://assets.pippa.io/shows/604b79bc69ef087644689f81/1655732707456-28c57a5606dd349fb8f0c0480945c29e.jpeg"/>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>Join us for an in-depth analysis of Leeds United's 2025/26 season with special guest Martin, a dedicated Leeds supporter! In this episode of Differential King's FPL podcast, we break down Leeds' impressive transfer window, tactical setup under manager FARC, and identify the best FPL assets from Elland Road.</p><br><p><strong>🔑 What We Cover:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Transfer Window Winners:</strong> Harry Wilson's free transfer coup, James Trafford's goalkeeping upgrade, and Tarek Muharemovic's aerial dominance</li><li><strong>Pre-Season Form:</strong> Comprehensive review of Leeds' impressive friendlies including victories over Liverpool (4-2) and Augsburg (4-0)</li><li><strong>Tactical Analysis:</strong> Why FARC's back-five system is perfect for this squad and Joe Rodon's "Joe Salah" attacking runs</li><li><strong>FPL Asset Rankings:</strong> Our top 3 Leeds picks including Dominic Calvert-Lewin, Stach vs Ampadu debate, and DEFCON defender options</li><li><strong>Season Predictions:</strong> Realistic expectations for Leeds' campaign and opening fixture analysis</li><li><strong>Early Season Strategy:</strong> Bench Boost GW2 discussion, Wildcard timing, and Triple Captain targets</li></ul><p><strong>⚽ Key Timestamps:</strong></p><ul><li>Transfer window assessment and remaining squad needs</li><li>Calvert-Lewin's pre-season form (3 goals, 2 assists)</li><li>Predicted GW1 lineup and tactical setup</li><li>Stach vs Ampadu: Which £5.5-6m midfielder should you pick?</li><li>Hot take: Trafford to be the season's top-scoring goalkeeper</li></ul><p><strong>🎯 FPL Takeaways:</strong></p><ul><li>Why Dominic Calvert-Lewin is non-negotiable when fit</li><li>The case for Stack as a £6m differential with set-piece threat</li><li>Muharemovic vs Rodon: Which Leeds defender offers better value?</li><li>Why Trafford at £5m is difficult to justify over £4.5m defenders</li></ul><p><br></p><p>Whether you're a Leeds fan or FPL manager looking for differential picks, this episode delivers tactical insights, asset analysis, and early-season strategy to give you the edge in your mini-leagues!</p><br><p>Presented by 'The FPL Guru' Alex Rex.</p><br><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Chapters: (AI GENERATED)</strong></p><p>00:00 Introduction &amp; Guest Welcome</p><p>02:15 Transfer Window Review - Harry Wilson, James Trafford &amp; Tarek Muharemovic </p><p>08:30 Remaining Transfer Needs - Backup GK &amp; Left Wing-Back Cover</p><p>12:45 FARC's Tactical Setup - Back Five System Analysis</p><p>18:20 Pre-Season Results Breakdown - Liverpool, Leipzig &amp; Augsburg Wins</p><p>24:10 Calvert-Lewin &amp; Aronson's Standout Performances</p><p>28:35 Season Expectations - 9th Place Prediction</p><p>32:50 Opening Five Fixtures Analysis</p><p>36:40 Predicted GW1 Starting Lineup</p><p>41:15 Top 3 Leeds FPL Assets - DCL, Stach &amp; Muharemovic</p><p>48:25 Ampadu vs Stach Debate - Who's the Better Pick?</p><p>52:40 Why Trafford at £5m is Difficult to Justify</p><p>56:30 Broader FPL Strategy - Bench Boost GW2 &amp; Wildcard Timing</p><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></description>
			<itunes:summary><![CDATA[<p>Join us for an in-depth analysis of Leeds United's 2025/26 season with special guest Martin, a dedicated Leeds supporter! In this episode of Differential King's FPL podcast, we break down Leeds' impressive transfer window, tactical setup under manager FARC, and identify the best FPL assets from Elland Road.</p><br><p><strong>🔑 What We Cover:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Transfer Window Winners:</strong> Harry Wilson's free transfer coup, James Trafford's goalkeeping upgrade, and Tarek Muharemovic's aerial dominance</li><li><strong>Pre-Season Form:</strong> Comprehensive review of Leeds' impressive friendlies including victories over Liverpool (4-2) and Augsburg (4-0)</li><li><strong>Tactical Analysis:</strong> Why FARC's back-five system is perfect for this squad and Joe Rodon's "Joe Salah" attacking runs</li><li><strong>FPL Asset Rankings:</strong> Our top 3 Leeds picks including Dominic Calvert-Lewin, Stach vs Ampadu debate, and DEFCON defender options</li><li><strong>Season Predictions:</strong> Realistic expectations for Leeds' campaign and opening fixture analysis</li><li><strong>Early Season Strategy:</strong> Bench Boost GW2 discussion, Wildcard timing, and Triple Captain targets</li></ul><p><strong>⚽ Key Timestamps:</strong></p><ul><li>Transfer window assessment and remaining squad needs</li><li>Calvert-Lewin's pre-season form (3 goals, 2 assists)</li><li>Predicted GW1 lineup and tactical setup</li><li>Stach vs Ampadu: Which £5.5-6m midfielder should you pick?</li><li>Hot take: Trafford to be the season's top-scoring goalkeeper</li></ul><p><strong>🎯 FPL Takeaways:</strong></p><ul><li>Why Dominic Calvert-Lewin is non-negotiable when fit</li><li>The case for Stack as a £6m differential with set-piece threat</li><li>Muharemovic vs Rodon: Which Leeds defender offers better value?</li><li>Why Trafford at £5m is difficult to justify over £4.5m defenders</li></ul><p><br></p><p>Whether you're a Leeds fan or FPL manager looking for differential picks, this episode delivers tactical insights, asset analysis, and early-season strategy to give you the edge in your mini-leagues!</p><br><p>Presented by 'The FPL Guru' Alex Rex.</p><br><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Chapters: (AI GENERATED)</strong></p><p>00:00 Introduction &amp; Guest Welcome</p><p>02:15 Transfer Window Review - Harry Wilson, James Trafford &amp; Tarek Muharemovic </p><p>08:30 Remaining Transfer Needs - Backup GK &amp; Left Wing-Back Cover</p><p>12:45 FARC's Tactical Setup - Back Five System Analysis</p><p>18:20 Pre-Season Results Breakdown - Liverpool, Leipzig &amp; Augsburg Wins</p><p>24:10 Calvert-Lewin &amp; Aronson's Standout Performances</p><p>28:35 Season Expectations - 9th Place Prediction</p><p>32:50 Opening Five Fixtures Analysis</p><p>36:40 Predicted GW1 Starting Lineup</p><p>41:15 Top 3 Leeds FPL Assets - DCL, Stach &amp; Muharemovic</p><p>48:25 Ampadu vs Stach Debate - Who's the Better Pick?</p><p>52:40 Why Trafford at £5m is Difficult to Justify</p><p>56:30 Broader FPL Strategy - Bench Boost GW2 &amp; Wildcard Timing</p><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></itunes:summary>
