			<description><![CDATA[<p>All In Football FPL Show - Fan View Series 26/27 EP 1 - Ipswich, Hull &amp; Coventry</p><br><p>Pre-season bonus podcast episode covering Ipswich Town and Hull City's Premier League preparations, featuring fan perspectives from Lewis (Ipswich) and Jack (Hull). Discussion spans managerial changes, transfer windows, relegation predictions, and FPL strategy for the upcoming season. All three participants agreed both promoted clubs face tough early fixtures but have realistic survival chances, with Coventry and Fulham identified as primary relegation candidates.</p><br><p>Presented by 'The FPL Guru' Alex Rex.</p><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></description>
			<itunes:summary><![CDATA[<p>All In Football FPL Show - Fan View Series 26/27 EP 1 - Ipswich, Hull &amp; Coventry</p><br><p>Pre-season bonus podcast episode covering Ipswich Town and Hull City's Premier League preparations, featuring fan perspectives from Lewis (Ipswich) and Jack (Hull). Discussion spans managerial changes, transfer windows, relegation predictions, and FPL strategy for the upcoming season. All three participants agreed both promoted clubs face tough early fixtures but have realistic survival chances, with Coventry and Fulham identified as primary relegation candidates.</p><br><p>Presented by 'The FPL Guru' Alex Rex.</p><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></itunes:summary>
