			<description><![CDATA[<p>All In Football FPL Show - Episode 185 - World Cup Review</p><br><p>This week Alex &amp; Scott are joined by former host of the All In Football Podcast, Tom Hughes, to discuss the fall out from the World Cup and England's Semi Final exit to Argentina.</p><br><p>Was this the mangers fault or is it the mentality and DNA issue of English football?</p><p>What would or could we have done differently and what are our lessons learnt?</p><br><p>Plus a Flop or Success quick fire on the top transfers in this years transfer window so far.</p><br><p>With Alex 'FPL Guru' Rex, Scott 'The Voice of the People' Williams and Thomas Hughes.</p><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></description>
