			<description><![CDATA[<p>All In Football FPL Show - Episode 141 - Review of the 2024/2025 Season</p><br><p>This week the lads are joined by a few special guests to discuss the 24/25 season.</p><br><p>A big thank you and congratulations to our back-to-back league champion, Ally Farrell, for coming on the podcast alongside our cup champion David Burn.</p><br><p>Special guest also include Kieran Ball (off of the Crystal Balls) and Phil Hallam who has featured prominently in our differential draft this season.</p><br><p>Like and comment and don't forget to subscribe. Thank you to all the listeners and watchers this season. We really appreciate you!</p><br><p>Hosted by The FPL Guru, Differential King and The Voice Of The People .</p><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></description>
			<itunes:summary><![CDATA[<p>All In Football FPL Show - Episode 141 - Review of the 2024/2025 Season</p><br><p>This week the lads are joined by a few special guests to discuss the 24/25 season.</p><br><p>A big thank you and congratulations to our back-to-back league champion, Ally Farrell, for coming on the podcast alongside our cup champion David Burn.</p><br><p>Special guest also include Kieran Ball (off of the Crystal Balls) and Phil Hallam who has featured prominently in our differential draft this season.</p><br><p>Like and comment and don't forget to subscribe. Thank you to all the listeners and watchers this season. We really appreciate you!</p><br><p>Hosted by The FPL Guru, Differential King and The Voice Of The People .</p><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></itunes:summary>
		</item>
