			<description><![CDATA[<p>All In Football FPL Show - Episode 131 - You Cunha written it</p><br><p>This week the lads discuss all things Free Hit GW29 and how to plan around the up and coming blanks and doubles. They look at the 'must haves' and the options for people Free Hitting, Dead ending and Wildcarding, and not Free Hitting and playing through.</p><br><p>Triple Captaincy is also discussed along with planning for the rest of the chips.</p><br><p>Along with the Pod Leagues manager of the Week for GW27 and Manager of the Month award for February, plus the usual features and a Scott Williams classic differential draft.</p><br><p>With Alex 'FPL Guru' Rex, Barry 'Mr Differential' Stokes, and 'The Voice of the People' Scott Williams.</p><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></description>
			<itunes:summary><![CDATA[<p>All In Football FPL Show - Episode 131 - You Cunha written it</p><br><p>This week the lads discuss all things Free Hit GW29 and how to plan around the up and coming blanks and doubles. They look at the 'must haves' and the options for people Free Hitting, Dead ending and Wildcarding, and not Free Hitting and playing through.</p><br><p>Triple Captaincy is also discussed along with planning for the rest of the chips.</p><br><p>Along with the Pod Leagues manager of the Week for GW27 and Manager of the Month award for February, plus the usual features and a Scott Williams classic differential draft.</p><br><p>With Alex 'FPL Guru' Rex, Barry 'Mr Differential' Stokes, and 'The Voice of the People' Scott Williams.</p><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></itunes:summary>
