			<acast:settings><![CDATA[]]></acast:settings>
			<itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
			<itunes:season>4</itunes:season>
			<itunes:episode>18</itunes:episode>
			<itunes:image href="https://assets.pippa.io/shows/604b79bc69ef087644689f81/1655732707456-28c57a5606dd349fb8f0c0480945c29e.jpeg"/>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>All In Football FPL Show - Episode 125 - The Long View</p><br><p>The chaps are back and there's a lot of league admin to get through. Four manger of the week and a manger of the month award are given out and The Guru takes a look at the state of play moving forward.</p><br><p>There's a detailed look at a chip strategy to work off, including when to use the new assistant manager chip!</p><br><p>Which teams and players are in form coming out of a busy festive period and where should we be investing our money moving forward.</p><br><p>They review their pre season predictions and make some new ones.</p><br><p>Plus all the usual features of the 3 week punt and the differential draft!</p><br><p>With Alex 'FPL Guru' Rex, Barry 'The Differential King' Stokes and Scott ' The Voice of the People' Williams.</p><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></description>
			<itunes:summary><![CDATA[<p>All In Football FPL Show - Episode 125 - The Long View</p><br><p>The chaps are back and there's a lot of league admin to get through. Four manger of the week and a manger of the month award are given out and The Guru takes a look at the state of play moving forward.</p><br><p>There's a detailed look at a chip strategy to work off, including when to use the new assistant manager chip!</p><br><p>Which teams and players are in form coming out of a busy festive period and where should we be investing our money moving forward.</p><br><p>They review their pre season predictions and make some new ones.</p><br><p>Plus all the usual features of the 3 week punt and the differential draft!</p><br><p>With Alex 'FPL Guru' Rex, Barry 'The Differential King' Stokes and Scott ' The Voice of the People' Williams.</p><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></itunes:summary>
