			<description><![CDATA[<p>All In Football Fantasy Premier League Show - Episode 108 - Pre Season Podcast - No Mo, No Problem</p><br><p>The guys are back! The pre season podcast is hear with all the information you need for game week 1.&nbsp;</p><p>The lads discuss the rule changes and how they will impact play this year.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The best teams to target for the start of the seasons.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Position by position analysis to find this seasons gems.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Pre season form.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Our predictions for the season ahead.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The ‘Guru’s’ current draft.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Feel free to join our free FPL mini league for weekly shout outs - na7543</p><p>https://fantasy.premierleague.com/leagues/auto-join/na7543</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Don’t forget to follow us on socials @allinfootballpod and @allinfootballp on Twitter,</p><p>Instagram and TikTok.&nbsp;</p><p>https://www.instagram.com/allinfootballpod/?next=%2F&amp;hl=en</p><p>https://x.com/AllInFootballP</p><br><p>With Alex 'FPL Guru' Rex, Barry Stokes and Scott Williams.</p><br><p>00:00 – Intro, Season Overview and Chips Strategy</p><p>08:04 – Rule Changes</p><p>13:14 – Fixtures for the first 7</p><p>19:15 – GKs and Defensive Rotation</p><p>38:46 – Summer Business</p><p>48:19 – Midfielders</p><p>01:01:19 – Strikers</p><p>01:10:40 – Drafts</p><p>01:15:24 – Predictions for the season</p><p>01:27:00 – FPL Challenge</p><p>01:27:44 – Captains, Fixtures and the Deadline</p><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></description>
