			<title>All In Football Fantasy Premier League Show - Episode 106 - Season Review 2023/24</title>
			<itunes:title>All In Football Fantasy Premier League Show - Episode 106 - Season Review 2023/24</itunes:title>
			<pubDate>Fri, 31 May 2024 15:42:29 GMT</pubDate>
			<itunes:duration>1:47:42</itunes:duration>
			<enclosure url="https://sphinx.acast.com/p/open/s/604b79bc69ef087644689f81/e/6659efe5f95ef10011b61a7e/media.mp3" length="102846331" type="audio/mpeg"/>
			<guid isPermaLink="false">6659efe5f95ef10011b61a7e</guid>
			<itunes:explicit>true</itunes:explicit>
			<link>https://shows.acast.com/all-in-football/episodes/all-in-football-fantasy-premier-league-show-episode-106-seas</link>
			<acast:episodeId>6659efe5f95ef10011b61a7e</acast:episodeId>
			<acast:showId>604b79bc69ef087644689f81</acast:showId>
			<acast:episodeUrl>all-in-football-fantasy-premier-league-show-episode-106-seas</acast:episodeUrl>
			<acast:settings><![CDATA[]]></acast:settings>
			<itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
			<itunes:season>3</itunes:season>
			<itunes:episode>38</itunes:episode>
			<itunes:image href="https://assets.pippa.io/shows/604b79bc69ef087644689f81/1655732707456-28c57a5606dd349fb8f0c0480945c29e.jpeg"/>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>All In Football Fantasy Premier League Show - Episode 106 - Season Review 2023/24</p><br><p>This week the lads review their FPL seasons along side a very special guest, the pod league champion Ally Farrell.</p><br><p>They discuss,</p><ul><li>The seasons stats</li><li>Captaincy and Hits</li><li>Chip Usage and Strategy</li><li>Seasons lessons learnt</li></ul><p><br></p><p>Barry discusses the finale of the differential draft and reviews our predictions from the beginning of the season.</p><br><p>Scott then wraps up with a discussion about England and the Euros.</p><br><p>Thank you all for listening this season!</p><br><p>With Alex 'FPL Guru' Rex, Scott Williams, Barry Stokes and Ally Farrell.</p><br><p>00:00 Intro</p><p>1:51 - GW38 Wrap Up - Manager of the Month Award</p><p>3:41 - Stat Attack for the 23/34 season</p><p>11:07 - Interview with Ally</p><p>17:50 - Our Season Stats</p><p>32:07 - Chip Usage</p><p>41:17 - Our Hero's and Villains</p><p>49:36 - Team of the season</p><p>58:18 - Dif Draft Round Up</p><p>1:01:28 - The Cup Champ - Barry</p><p>1:05:11 - CL and FA Cup Format</p><p>1:09:55 - Our Lessons Learnt</p><p>1:17:17 - Prem Team of the Year</p><p>1:24:48 - Predictions Review</p><p>1:31:00 - Quick Fire</p><p>1:37:47 - England Chat</p><p>1:46:24 - Wrap Up &amp; Thank You</p><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></description>
			<itunes:summary><![CDATA[<p>All In Football Fantasy Premier League Show - Episode 106 - Season Review 2023/24</p><br><p>This week the lads review their FPL seasons along side a very special guest, the pod league champion Ally Farrell.</p><br><p>They discuss,</p><ul><li>The seasons stats</li><li>Captaincy and Hits</li><li>Chip Usage and Strategy</li><li>Seasons lessons learnt</li></ul><p><br></p><p>Barry discusses the finale of the differential draft and reviews our predictions from the beginning of the season.</p><br><p>Scott then wraps up with a discussion about England and the Euros.</p><br><p>Thank you all for listening this season!</p><br><p>With Alex 'FPL Guru' Rex, Scott Williams, Barry Stokes and Ally Farrell.</p><br><p>00:00 Intro</p><p>1:51 - GW38 Wrap Up - Manager of the Month Award</p><p>3:41 - Stat Attack for the 23/34 season</p><p>11:07 - Interview with Ally</p><p>17:50 - Our Season Stats</p><p>32:07 - Chip Usage</p><p>41:17 - Our Hero's and Villains</p><p>49:36 - Team of the season</p><p>58:18 - Dif Draft Round Up</p><p>1:01:28 - The Cup Champ - Barry</p><p>1:05:11 - CL and FA Cup Format</p><p>1:09:55 - Our Lessons Learnt</p><p>1:17:17 - Prem Team of the Year</p><p>1:24:48 - Predictions Review</p><p>1:31:00 - Quick Fire</p><p>1:37:47 - England Chat</p><p>1:46:24 - Wrap Up &amp; Thank You</p><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></itunes:summary>
		</item>
