			<description><![CDATA[<p>All In Football Fantasy Premier League Show - Episode 100 - With a ton of special guests!</p><br><p>This week the guys are celebrating a special milestone, 100 episodes! Thank you to all the listeners who have tuned in over the last 3 seasons and supported us.</p><br><p>They are joined by one of our original creators, who chose our theme song and put our graphics together, Martin Weal. One of our original hosts Tom Hughes, and from across the pond, Mr differential himself, Guy Ferguson!</p><br><p>Alex, Scott and Barry cover chip strategy for the rest of the season, the announcements of the Double Gameweeks in 35 &amp; 37, and the best players to pick from our title challengers.</p><br><p>Don't forget, the AIF mini league cup starts this week!</p><br><p>With Alex 'FPL Guru' Rex, Barry Stokes and Scott Williams.</p><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></description>
			<itunes:summary><![CDATA[<p>All In Football Fantasy Premier League Show - Episode 100 - With a ton of special guests!</p><br><p>This week the guys are celebrating a special milestone, 100 episodes! Thank you to all the listeners who have tuned in over the last 3 seasons and supported us.</p><br><p>They are joined by one of our original creators, who chose our theme song and put our graphics together, Martin Weal. One of our original hosts Tom Hughes, and from across the pond, Mr differential himself, Guy Ferguson!</p><br><p>Alex, Scott and Barry cover chip strategy for the rest of the season, the announcements of the Double Gameweeks in 35 &amp; 37, and the best players to pick from our title challengers.</p><br><p>Don't forget, the AIF mini league cup starts this week!</p><br><p>With Alex 'FPL Guru' Rex, Barry Stokes and Scott Williams.</p><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></itunes:summary>
