			<description><![CDATA[<p>All In Football Fantasy Premier League Show - Episode 91 - Going mad on the Hatters</p><br><p>This week the guys review the last 2 gameweeks and look that landscape from now until GW29. Planning how to navigate it with or without chips.</p><br><p>They also cover the inform players and discuss who to buy and who you can go without.</p><br><p>Along with the usual features of differential draft, manager of the week and captain picks. This weeks differential draft is one with a valentines twist.</p><br><p>With Alex 'FPL Guru' Rex, Scott Williams and Barry Stokes.</p><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></description>
