			<description><![CDATA[<p>All In Football Fantasy Premier League Show - Episode 66 - Review of the 22/23 FPL Season with interviews from special guests!</p><br><p>This week the lads get together one last time to discuss the FPL season. The champion Barry Stokes talks through his year. Len Deakin talks through his amazing cup run. Plus we have our leading lady, Heather Howcroft, on the podcast and this years second place manager (and all time leading FPL manger in our league) Geoff Belcher.</p><br><p>In this bumper edition we discuss the highs and lows of the season, the top performing players and some shocking statistics! </p><br><p>With The FPL Guru Alex Rex, Scott Williams, Barry Stokes, Geoff Belcher, Heather Howcroft and Len Deakin.</p><br><p>00:00 - Intro , Interview with the champ</p><p>14:00 - Len Interview, Cup Champ!</p><p>25:45 - Scott's Team, Formation and Position stats</p><p>32:22 - Heather Interview, Leading Lady!</p><p>46:26 - Geoff Interview</p><p>63:00 - Players of the season</p><p>83:50 - Heros and Trolls</p><p>87:29 - Turning Points</p><p>92:50 - Managers of the Months</p><p>94:15 - Differential league &amp; Wrap Up</p><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></description>
			<itunes:summary><![CDATA[<p>All In Football Fantasy Premier League Show - Episode 66 - Review of the 22/23 FPL Season with interviews from special guests!</p><br><p>This week the lads get together one last time to discuss the FPL season. The champion Barry Stokes talks through his year. Len Deakin talks through his amazing cup run. Plus we have our leading lady, Heather Howcroft, on the podcast and this years second place manager (and all time leading FPL manger in our league) Geoff Belcher.</p><br><p>In this bumper edition we discuss the highs and lows of the season, the top performing players and some shocking statistics! </p><br><p>With The FPL Guru Alex Rex, Scott Williams, Barry Stokes, Geoff Belcher, Heather Howcroft and Len Deakin.</p><br><p>00:00 - Intro , Interview with the champ</p><p>14:00 - Len Interview, Cup Champ!</p><p>25:45 - Scott's Team, Formation and Position stats</p><p>32:22 - Heather Interview, Leading Lady!</p><p>46:26 - Geoff Interview</p><p>63:00 - Players of the season</p><p>83:50 - Heros and Trolls</p><p>87:29 - Turning Points</p><p>92:50 - Managers of the Months</p><p>94:15 - Differential league &amp; Wrap Up</p><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></itunes:summary>
