			<description><![CDATA[<p>All In Football Fantasy Premier League Show - Episode 40 - FPL Is Back!</p><br><p>The Premier League is back and so is FPL. The 'FPL Guru' talks through the wildcard template and who's fixtures to target from now until the World Cup. Scott gives his views on England and also the managerial changes that have taken place so far this season.</p><br><p>With Alex Rex and Scott Williams</p><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></description>
			<itunes:summary><![CDATA[<p>All In Football Fantasy Premier League Show - Episode 40 - FPL Is Back!</p><br><p>The Premier League is back and so is FPL. The 'FPL Guru' talks through the wildcard template and who's fixtures to target from now until the World Cup. Scott gives his views on England and also the managerial changes that have taken place so far this season.</p><br><p>With Alex Rex and Scott Williams</p><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></itunes:summary>
