			<guid isPermaLink="false">611f89d44b05cd0013d7f780</guid>
			<itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
			<link>https://shows.acast.com/all-in-football/episodes/the-prem-is-back</link>
			<acast:episodeId>611f89d44b05cd0013d7f780</acast:episodeId>
			<acast:showId>604b79bc69ef087644689f81</acast:showId>
			<acast:episodeUrl>the-prem-is-back</acast:episodeUrl>
			<acast:settings><![CDATA[]]></acast:settings>
			<itunes:subtitle><![CDATA[Opening Day Shocks & Strong Title Challengers]]></itunes:subtitle>
			<itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
			<itunes:season>2</itunes:season>
			<itunes:episode>1</itunes:episode>
			<itunes:image href="https://assets.pippa.io/shows/604b79bc69ef087644689f81/1629456307896-93083cf45a6c3d7498f611d8ce6908a6.jpeg"/>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>The Premier League is back and so are we! Welcome back to another season of All in Football. This week we cover the opening day of the Premier League including all the shock results, as well as the strong starts from this year main title challengers. For those outside the Premier League, we also discuss the first few games in the Championship to League Two. Finally we talk about the first week of fantasy football, rounded out by quickfire questions.</p><br><p>We hope you enjoy the show!</p><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></description>
